-- g8-tests-fees.l4: what each vintage of the Fees Regulations prints, for every head of section 59.
--
-- Every expected value below was decided from the source (the gazette page images of Kovetz HaTakanot 11951 p. 2116
-- and 12383 p. 2062, and the 400 dpi crop of the SimpLEX screenshot) BEFORE any module was run; work/g8/expectations.md
-- section 2 is the table.  Nothing here restates the code.  The rows come from a generator that reads that table
-- (work/g8/gen_tests_fees.py), so that no row is typed by hand.
--
-- THE POINT OF THE FILE: a vintage that is silent on a service answers NOTHING, and no figure crosses from one
-- vintage to another.  Each (vintage, service) pair is asserted for the figure, its provision in that vintage's
-- own numbering, its payer, and silence.

